&dm <user> <message> - DMs a user a message. Please make sure the user actually has their DMs open, otherwise the message will be lost.
&chaos - Chaos mode. This message will ping everyone and then spam the channel with random characters. It's not recommended for obvious reasons.
&help - Shows this message.
